-- Heavy spoilers --

The way to handle Death, typically, is to keep a buffer of other
monsters between you and them.  While Wands of Death were nerfed a few
versions ago when the demon lords and princes were made immune to their
rays, they still work against Pestilence and Famine.

The best ways to cure Pestilence's sickness is a spell of cure
sickness, but in the likely absence of that, note that uncursed potions
of extra healing and full healing also cure sickness.  Also, unicorn
horns cure ailments more often when they are blessed.

- John H.

